WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:06.400
You ask AI to make a document shorter. It leaves out something important.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:11.600
Here, the policy allows refunds, but excludes renewal payments.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:16.467
The summary keeps the refund window, but drops that exception.

00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:22.333
Lossless lets you mark what must stay. Jev checks the rewrite.

00:00:22.453 --> 00:00:26.400
It repairs the missing idea, then checks again.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:31.933
Some text must stay word for word. Use Keep wording.

00:00:32.053 --> 00:00:36.800
For a whole section, extract its key ideas with Must cover.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:41.867
You can also check a draft you already have, and repair it if needed.

00:00:41.987 --> 00:00:48.367
Then change the tone or length. Your selected ideas stay part of the checks.
